WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.302
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.302 --> 00:00:06.394
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.394 --> 00:00:09.894
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.894 --> 00:00:10.241
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:10.241 --> 00:00:13.848
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:17.499
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:17.509 --> 00:00:28.435
Write what changes during the training experiment.

00:00:28.435 --> 00:00:31.717
Reveal the training explanation for comparison.

00:00:31.717 --> 00:00:35.240
Move to the prompt experiment.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:45.548
Explain the effect of a definition in the prompt.

00:00:45.548 --> 00:00:51.596
Reveal the expected prompt explanation.

00:00:51.596 --> 00:00:55.208
Open the retrieval experiment.

00:00:55.208 --> 00:01:05.627
Write the retrieval decision and its limitation.

00:01:05.627 --> 00:01:11.778
Reveal the expected retrieval explanation.

00:01:11.778 --> 00:01:16.502
Review the completed case-study progress.

00:01:16.502 --> 00:01:24.117
Return to the first experiment and inspect the saved response.
